0 541 802 [
[(*** The table is now 1 million points and takes)]
[(about 23 seconds to fill, we also use the)]
[('fast-forward' message to fill it.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 26 814 [
[(Here is how to use the [tabread~]'s "onset" input to allow clean)]
[(varispeed playback from a long table. At left, a [phasor~] is naively)]
[(rescaled to the size of the table. At right, the [phasor~] gets only)]
[(a 10000-point range about a moving "onset". Ten times per second, we)]
[(poll the [phasor~]'s phase, sum its value into the onset, and back up)]
[(the phase of the [phasor~] correspondingly.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 26 724 [
[(The tricky bits are, first, that we need to poll the [phasor~]'s)]
[(phase one sample into the future \050so we add the per-sample increment)]
[(into the [snapshot~] result\051. Second, we can't just reset the)]
[([phasor~] to a fixed point - instead, we measure how much the onset)]
[(has actually increased \050which has truncation error from summing in)]
[(the phase snapshot\051, and subtract that increase from the phase,)]
[(giving a value that differs from zero by the truncation error but)]
[(reflects the true phase we should reset to for continuity.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 26 605 [
[(The metronome rate is arbitrary but should be fast enough that the)]
[([phasor~] never has time to wrap.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 449 545 [
[(<-- reset phase. 0.5 causes trouble for the "bad" way.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 88 545 [
[(<-- playback speed, samples/sec)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 580 408 [
[(Each 100 msec, poll phase of [phasor~])]
[(in order to change onset to reflect it)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 106 413 [
[(naive way: just)]
[(run a phasor)]
[(into [tabread4~])]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
